I want you to act as a senior HTML5 game developer and build a complete browser-based game called **"Flappy Friends: College Edition"**.

### Tech Stack

* React + Vite
* HTML5 Canvas
* Tailwind CSS
* JavaScript (no TypeScript)
* No backend required
* Store highscores in localStorage

### Game Concept

The game is a customized Flappy Bird clone based on my friend group and college life.

Players choose a character before starting.

Characters are represented by custom PNG images that I will provide later.

### Core Gameplay

* Classic Flappy Bird mechanics.
* Spacebar, mouse click, or touch causes the character to flap.
* Gravity pulls the character downward.
* Obstacles move from right to left.
* Passing an obstacle increases score by 1.
* Collision ends the game.

